hot men geshikt

445
00:21:41,543 --> 00:21:44,544
di eltere. undz ze'mir geven tsuzamen

446
00:21:44,736 --> 00:21:46,479
hobn mir geveynt, un m'hot

447
00:21:46,479 --> 00:21:49,134
m'hot undz gelozt ale dray tsuzamen.

448
00:21:49,292 --> 00:21:52,006
zenen mir geven in kinderheym. in a tsimer

449
00:21:52,006 --> 00:21:54,163
WAR eyn un zibetsik betn.

450
00:21:54,422 --> 00:21:56,323
dos farges ikh oykh nisht.

451
00:21:56,565 --> 00:22:00,491
un mayn kleyn bruderl iz geshlofn a g- oykh mit undz

452
00:22:00,632 --> 00:22:04,136
in a kleyn betl. in di fri ⟨flegt men⟩ darfn geyn in shul

453
00:22:05,003 --> 00:22:09,705
hob ikh im ibergelozt. ⟨ven ikh bin⟩ gekumen tsurik, hob ikh im gedarft arumzukhn. ikh hob nisht gevust vu er iz.

454
00:22:09,795 --> 00:22:14,508
fleg er zayn bay farshidene FAMILIEN. zey flegn im gebn broyt, fleg geyn oyf

455
00:22:14,508 --> 00:22:17,231
⟨oyf⟩ mir gebn, mayn GROSSEN bruder

456
00:22:17,305 --> 00:22:19,509
azoy hobn ⟨zey undz⟩ gehaltn tsuzamen

457
00:22:19,853 --> 00:22:22,833
biz ikh hob geshribn a briv NACH Vizhnits

458
00:22:22,833 --> 00:22:26,443
un ikh hob dort gehat a tante. dos iz a shvester fun mayn mame

459
00:22:27,683 --> 00:22:31,305
UND DIE hot undz geshikt a briv, undz zoln mir kumen.

460
00:22:32,391 --> 00:22:37,366
hot men GEWARTET biz s'iz geven nokh finef kin- nokh kinder, finef oyf a UNK

461
00:22:37,366 --> 00:22:38,496
un m'hot undz

462
00:22:38,496 --> 00:22:40,367
mit a lererin gebrengt

463
00:22:40,626 --> 00:22:44,973
NACH Tshernovits. fun dort zenen mir aleyn geforn nokh Vizhnits.

464
00:22:45,165 --> 00:22:50,964
iz vi lang zent ir geven in dem, in ODESSA in dem yidishn kin- in dem goyishn kinderheym?

465
00:22:51,375 --> 00:22:52,803
FAST a yor.

466
00:22:53,434 --> 00:22:56,161
un ir zent geven alts yidishe kinder dort?

467
00:22:55,662 --> 00:23:00,752
i- FAST ale yi- iz geven gemisht, ober nayntsik protsent iz geven yidishe kinder.

468
00:22:57,585 --> 00:22:58,507
yo?

469
00:23:01,112 --> 00:23:02,206
un

470
00:23:02,206 --> 00:23:03,758
dos hot nisht geshtert

471
00:23:03,758 --> 00:23:05,898
s'iz yeder hot gevust s'iz yidishe kinder?

472
00:23:05,601 --> 00:23:09,082
m'hot gevust. undz ho'mir zikh gehaltn tsuzamen.

473
00:23:09,082 --> 00:23:11,689
me fleg brengen no- kinder andere

474
00:23:11,689 --> 00:23:16,040
di flegn BEKOMMEN kleyder, un nokh dem zenen zey vider avek.

475
00:23:16,468 --> 00:23:18,875
un di yidishe kinder hot men dort gelozt?

476
00:23:17,717 --> 00:23:20,849
zenen mir ge- undz ho'mir gehaltn zikh tsuzamen.

477
00:23:20,637 --> 00:23:23,516
un ir gedenkt nokh dem nomen fun dem kinderheym?

478
00:23:23,674 --> 00:23:28,438
dos iz geheysn h- kinderheym. der nomen hot dos nisht ge⟨UNK⟩

479
00:23:28,438 --> 00:23:29,557
⟨nit⟩ gehat keyn NAHME.

480
00:23:30,272 --> 00:23:31,717
S'WAR NUR

481
00:23:31,723 --> 00:23:32,454
in

482
00:23:32,454 --> 00:23:33,506
in a

483
00:23:33,985 --> 00:23:36,909
zekhtsnte STATION in ODESSA

484
00:23:36,909 --> 00:23:41,319
un di STATION hot geheysn LUSTDORF. hobn GEWOHNT dort DEUTSCHE.

485
00:23:41,460 --> 00:23:42,635
shvabn

486
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,660
un mit di hob ikh mikh

487
00:23:44,835 --> 00:23:51,970
gekent farshtendikn, vayl di hobn geredt DEUTSCH. ICH hob oykh gekent DEUTSCH, ober ven er hot geredt langzam, hob ikh im farshtanen.

488
00:23:51,970 --> 00:23:53,739
DIE WAREN fun Shvabn.

489
00:23:53,897 --> 00:23:55,477
hot men GESAGT azoy.

490
00:23:56,192 --> 00:24:00,776
un in mayne tsaytn nokh in Ades, hot men dan di ale likvidirt.

491
00:24:01,221 --> 00:24:02,669
iber nakht

492
00:24:02,669 --> 00:24:04,590
hot men ale derfer

493
00:24:05,338 --> 00:24:06,575
ler gemakht.

494
00:24:06,575 --> 00:24:11,846
dos WAR LUSTDORF, ALEXANDERDORF, KATHARINENDORF, ⟨BADINA⟩

495
00:24:12,443 --> 00:24:14,664
UND HEUTE vos se kumen di

496
00:24:14,923 --> 00:24:17,161
di DEUTSCHE oyszidler fun

497
00:24:17,725 --> 00:24:19,862
KAZAKHSTAN un fun

498
00:24:20,138 --> 00:24:23,405
ASIEN DORT. yetst DIE SINT ALE

499
00:24:23,563 --> 00:24:25,197
NUR VIERZIG yor

500
00:24:25,197 --> 00:24:26,780
oder merer vos zenen

501
00:24:26,871 --> 00:24:27,931
ober di

502
00:24:27,931 --> 00:24:32,808
shoyresh zeyere iz nisht fun dort. DIE SINT fun ODESSA un fun di VOLGA

503
00:24:32,808 --> 00:24:33,969
ahin farshikt.

504
00:24:35,697 --> 00:24:41,903
un i- in dem yor in dem kinderheym hot ir epes gehert fun mishpokhe, fun

505
00:24:40,776 --> 00:24:41,985
gornisht.

506
00:24:41,903 --> 00:24:43,841
tsi se lebt emetser?

507
00:24:42,649 --> 00:24:43,807
s'iz NUR

508
00:24:43,864 --> 00:24:47,469
m'hot emets gezukht? s'iz geven organizatsyes vos zey hobn z-

509
00:24:46,412 --> 00:24:48,937
neyn, gornisht gehert. ven ikh

510
00:24:49,618 --> 00:24:52,329
ze nisht vos andere hobn gemakht, m'hot

511
00:24:52,453 --> 00:24:57,256
m'hot gevolt aroys. zey hobn gezen, zenen mir arayngefaln. undz ho'mir gevolt aheym.

512
00:24:57,803 --> 00:24:59,299
un zey hobn undz geshikt

513
00:25:00,250 --> 00:25:07,129
undz ze'mir geven aynge⟨UNK⟩ gut, un dort di kinder fun kinderheym zenen gan barves un naket, mit galoshn azoy

514
00:25:08,350 --> 00:25:16,832
un nokh dem hob ikh, hot mikh di tante geshribn a briv. UNK bin ikh aroys UNK gekent blaybn nokh biz haynt. s'iz geblibn a sakh kinder nokh dort.

515
00:25:16,922 --> 00:25:18,603
ikh veys vu zey zenen.

516
00:25:19,167 --> 00:25:22,097
iz di tante hot aykh geshikt a briv?

517
00:25:21,850 --> 00:25:25,016
yo. dos iz geven genug, iz UNK shraybn oyfn briv

518
00:25:25,107 --> 00:25:27,362
az ir zolt kumen tsu mir.

519
00:25:28,296 --> 00:25:32,340
hot men tsuzamengeNOMMEN finef kinder, un m'hot undz mit a lererin

520
00:25:33,122 --> 00:25:35,866
a, a oyfzeerin oder vi UNK.

521
00:25:36,210 --> 00:25:38,988
hot men aykh geshikt tsuri- keyn Vizhnits.

522
00:25:38,252 --> 00:25:44,338
yo. zi hot undz aropgelozt in Tshernovits, vayl di andere kinder hot zi gedarft bagleytn ergets vu ⟨in⟩ andere shtet

523
00:25:44,344 --> 00:25:47,088
un fun dort zenen mir aleyn geforn keyn Vizhnits.

524
00:25:46,588 --> 00:25:49,653
vi azoy di lererin hot geheysn gedenkt ir nokh?

525
00:25:49,423 --> 00:25:50,716
di lererin

526
00:25:51,448 --> 00:25:53,315
⟨BELA LIVOVNA⟩

527
00:25:53,406 --> 00:25:55,070
a yidishe tsufelik.

528
00:25:56,983 --> 00:25:59,086
zent ir ongekumen tsu di mume

529
00:25:58,890 --> 00:26:03,021
yo, iz gevorn a, a geveyneray in shtetl, ober shoyn

530
00:26:03,021 --> 00:26:04,790
oyfn veg funem

531
00:26:04,915 --> 00:26:06,141
BAHNHOF

532
00:26:06,889 --> 00:26:11,945
tsu undz aheym iz geven di shtot mir shoyn azoy vi a GEISTE shtot.

533
00:26:12,002 --> 00:26:14,949
s'iz geven az- gants HOCH MIT GRAS

534
00:26:15,360 --> 00:26:20,250
un nokh hot men mir gezogt az ven m'hot fartribn di JUDEN fun Vizhnits

535
00:26:20,250 --> 00:26:21,969
iz di shtot geven

536
00:26:22,279 --> 00:26:24,247
azoy vi a, toyt

537
00:26:24,928 --> 00:26:27,470
s'hot gevakst gants hoykh GRAS

538
00:26:27,510 --> 00:26:28,786
oyf di STRASS.

539
00:26:29,215 --> 00:26:34,254
un vu undz, vu undz ho'mir gevoynt, undzer hoyz, iz geven tseklapt

540
00:26:34,767 --> 00:26:36,921
un s'hot shoyn gevaksn a boym.

541
00:26:36,977 --> 00:26:43,164
un mayn bruder der elterer hot mir gezogt az do vu der boym vakst iz geven a mol dos bet fun tate mame.

542
00:26:44,976 --> 00:26:45,830
un

543
00:26:45,702 --> 00:26:47,721
un di mume iz geven aleyn?

544
00:26:47,322 --> 00:26:50,927
neyn, mit, mitn man un mit a tokhter.

545
00:26:51,810 --> 00:26:53,441
vi hot geheysn di mume?

546
00:26:53,380 --> 00:26:54,454
Khane.

547
00:26:55,995 --> 00:26:58,655
un der onkl hot geheysn DEUTSCH.

548
00:26:58,982 --> 00:27:01,034
Gedalye's.

549
00:27:01,159 --> 00:27:05,644
di mame hot geheysn DEUTSCH un Khane oykh fun IHRE SEITE, un fun

550
00:27:05,644 --> 00:27:10,141
onkl zayt hot oykh geheysn leder, vayl er WAR a SCHWAGER fun mayn tate

551
00:27:10,141 --> 00:27:11,463
un a kuzin.

552
00:27:14,558 --> 00:27:15,736
un

553
00:27:15,013 --> 00:27:17,757
un hob ikh gezogt "do blayb ikh nisht"

554
00:27:17,781 --> 00:27:22,415
un er hot gearbet bay di rusn oykh in di zelbe baruf vi

555
00:27:22,793 --> 00:27:24,156
far di krig

556
00:27:24,156 --> 00:27:27,039
ober yetst alts ayngeshtelter bay di rusn

557
00:27:27,045 --> 00:27:29,570
gehat a WAGEN mit tsvey gute ferd

558
00:27:29,779 --> 00:27:34,501
hot er undz arayngezetst oyfn WAGEN, zenen mir geforn fun Vizhnits NACH Tshernovits

559
00:27:34,501 --> 00:27:36,894
akhtsik kilometer a gantse nakht.

560
00:27:37,828 --> 00:27:40,218
in Tshernovits hob ikh gehat a onkl

561
00:27:41,305 --> 00:27:42,936
dem tate's a bruder

562
00:27:44,427 --> 00:27:48,454
un er hot nisht gevolt mikh oyfnemen, tsi er hot nisht gekent

563
00:27:48,662 --> 00:27:52,186
hot mir gevolt shikn tsurik in a, a kinderheym.

